# Dev: Vite proxies /api → API_PROXY_TARGET (default http://localhost:4000).
# Start the backend (`cd backend && npm run dev`) or you get ECONNREFUSED on /api/*.
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:4000

# REQUIRED for `npm run build` / static hosting unless /api is reverse-proxied to your API.
# Without it, /api/* returns index.html → "Unexpected token '<'" / invalid JSON.
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
# VITE_API_URL=

# For `vite preview` locally, point at your API (dev proxy is not used):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
